mpany structure uploaded is no longer accurate, please upload a new company structure signed by the managing director. If the management structure in the business plan is no longer accurate, please upload an updated business plan. Also, please ensure that the passport number of the UBO (Grzegorz Skurjat) on the company structure is correct.","notes":null},{"title":"Business and Corporate information Form Enclosures: Share Legder","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-17","description":"The share ledger of the intermediate companies must be uploaded separately. Kindly upload a certified copy.","notes":null},{"title":"Gamma Plan Limited - Share Legder","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Kindly upload a certified true copy share ledger of Gamma Plan Limited in the designated share ledger tab.","notes":null},{"title":"Venturegamez N.V. - Directors List","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please note that the certification on the directors list is of the authenticity of the signature of the managing director, which cannot be accepted. Please submit a copy of the directors list certified as a true copy.","notes":"Applicant reply: It was shared in a separate ticket."},{"title":"Delta Plan Limited - Articles of Incorporation","tag":"Articles of Incorporation","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Kindly upload a certified true copy the Articles of Incorporation of Delta Plan Limited.","notes":null},{"title":"VentureGamez N.V. - goAML registration","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please note that the proof of goAML registration is missing. Kindly submit a screenshot of the admin page when logged in to the goAML portal. To do this, log in to the goAML portal, click Admin, select Active Organizations and take a screenshot of the page. Please upload the screenshot in the Extra Documentation section.","notes":null},{"title":"VentureGamez N.V. - Declaration of Good Standing","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"A certified copy of the Declaration of Good Standing in English, confirming compliance with tax and social contribution obligations, was not provided. Kindly submit the requested Declaration of Good Standing (verzoek verklaring betalingsgedrag) in the extra documentation section and name the file Declaration of Good Standing.","notes":"It was shared in a separate ticket."},{"title":"Source of Funds of Business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please provide the loan agreement for the loan from a third-party corporate entity. The loan agreement must be signed and certified as a true copy.","notes":"Both documents were included."},{"title":"Missing Compliance Officer","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"The Personal History Disclosure form and enclosures of the Compliance Officer are missing. Kindly add the Compliance Officer in the portal and upload the Personal History Disclosure form along with all enclosures (except source of wealth). In addition, a CV and a letter of engagement (signed by the compliance officer and managing director) are required. Please note that all enclosures must be duly certified with the exception of the CV and letter of engagement.","notes":"Applicant reply: Regarding the compliance officer, I can confirm that we are currently addressing the matter and will provide an update in due course."},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - PHDF: PAGE 2: QUESTION 15-20","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-17","description":"The questions 15–20 cannot be verified as the original passport has not been uploaded.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Proof of Employment","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"The evidence of employment pertaining to questions 34 - 39 is missing. Kindly submit certified copies of the evidence of the current employment in the Extra Documentation section.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Birth Certificate","tag":"Birth Certificate","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please provide a certified true copy of the birth certificate.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Passport","tag":"Passport","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"The original passport has not been uploaded. Kindly submit a duly certified copy of the passport.","notes":"Applicant reply: This was uploaded."},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Bank reference letter","tag":"Reference Letter","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"The bank reference letter must be certified as a true copy. Kindly upload the duly certified copy of the reference letter.","notes":null},{"title":"Gamma Plan Limited - Articles of Incorporation","tag":"Articles of Incorporation","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Kindly upload the Articles of Incorporation of Gamma Plan Limited.","notes":null},{"title":"Online Gaming Application Form - Page 4: Question 22","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please note that the passport number entered in question 22 is not correct. Please enter the correct passport number and resubmit the form.","notes":null},{"title":"Business and Corporate Information Form - Page 3: Question 12.1","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please note that it is not necessary to list the UBO in question 12.1 unless he also holds a c-suite level position (CEO, CTO, etc.). In question 12.1, please list all those holding c-suite level positions and it is mandatory to list a compliance officer. Please note that all persons listed in question 12.1 must be added to the portal and the Personal History Disclosure Form along with enclosures must be uploaded.","notes":"Applicant reply: UBO is both UBO and CEO/CTO. That is why he was inserted on the 12.1."},{"title":"Venturegamez N.V. - Share Ledger","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please note that the certification on the share ledger is of the authenticity of the signature of the managing director, which cannot be accepted. Please submit a copy of the share ledger certified as a true copy.","notes":"Applicant reply: It was shared in a separate ticket."},{"title":"Delta Plan Limited - Directors List","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please upload the Directors List of Delta Plan Limited in the designated Directors List section. Please note that the Directors List must be certified as a true copy.","notes":null},{"title":"Gamma Plan Limited - Directors List","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please upload the Directors List of Gamma Plan Limited in the designated Directors List section. Please note that the Directors List must be certified as a true copy.","notes":null},{"title":"Venturegamez N.V. - Business Plan","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"The management structure outlined in the business plan does not match that on the company structure. Also, a detailed 3-year forecast must be added in the business plan.","notes":"Applicant reply: Please find updated business plan in the business plan section."},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Personal History Disclosure Form - Page 1: Questions 9 & 10","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-11","description":"Please complete questions 9 and 10 and resubmit the form.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Criminal Record","tag":"Criminal Record","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please note that the original criminal record must be certified as a true copy. The statement of certification as a true copy must be in English. Please submit a certified copy of the original criminal record.","notes":"Applicant reply: This was sent."},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Proof of Address","tag":"Proof of Address","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please note that the proof of address document is more than 6 months old and cannot be accepted. Please provide a new proof of address document issued within the last 6 months. Please note that the original document must be submitted and certified as a true copy. If the document is not in English, an English translation (certified by the translator) must also be submitted.","notes":"This was added on the Extra Documents section."},{"title":"Acara Corporate Director Limited - Directors List","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"Please provide a certified copy of the directors list of Acara Corporate Director Limited (the director of Delta Plan Limited).","notes":"Applicant reply: This was sent."},{"title":"Menno Jordaan - Managing Director","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"The Managing Director, Menno Jordaan, must be added to the portal and the Personal History Disclosure Short Form must be uploaded.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Roles in Portal","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"As per the updated business plan, Grzegorz Skurjat is also the CEO and CTO. Please add these roles in the portal.","notes":null},{"title":"Grzegorz Skurjat - Personal History Disclosure Form - Page 5: Question 27","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-14","description":"As per the business plan, in addition to being the UBO, Grzegorz Skurjat is also the CEO and CTO. These roles must also be indicated in question 27. Please select 'Other Key Function Holder', enter the roles in the corresponding field, and resubmit the form.","notes":null}]}]}]}